<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-weishu-weishou" book-id="b-weishu-weishou-063" chapter-id="c-weishu-weishou-063-wangsu-father-and-brother" source-id="s-weishu-weishou-063-wangsu-father-and-brother-ws1513418">
  <p id="c-weishu-weishou-063-wangsu-father-and-brother:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-weishu-weishou-063-wangsu-father-and-brother:p001:m0000" ref="l1w_swd_dj8">王肅</persName>，字<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-063-wangsu-father-and-brother:p001:m0004" ref="l1w_swd_dj8">恭懿</persName>，琅邪臨沂人，<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-063-wangsu-father-and-brother:p001:m0013" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAAAA">司馬衍</persName>丞相<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-063-wangsu-father-and-brother:p001:m0018" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAA">導</persName>之後也。父<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-063-wangsu-father-and-brother:p001:m0024" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AA">奐</persName>，<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-063-wangsu-father-and-brother:p001:m0026" ref="kix_r92_2ed">蕭賾</persName>尚書左僕射。</p>
  <p id="c-weishu-weishou-063-wangsu-father-and-brother:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">父<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-063-wangsu-father-and-brother:p002:m0001" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AA">奐</persName>及兄弟並為<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-063-wangsu-father-and-brother:p002:m0007" ref="kix_r92_2ed">蕭賾</persName>所殺，<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-063-wangsu-father-and-brother:p002:m0012" ref="l1w_swd_dj8">肅</persName>自建業來奔，是歲，太和十七年也。</p>
  <p id="c-weishu-weishou-063-wangsu-father-and-brother:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-weishu-weishou-063-wangsu-father-and-brother:p003:m0000" ref="l1w_swd_dj8">肅</persName>弟<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-063-wangsu-father-and-brother:p003:m0002" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AAF">秉</persName>，字<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-063-wangsu-father-and-brother:p003:m0005" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AAF">文政</persName>。涉獵書史，微有兄風。</p>
  <p id="c-weishu-weishou-063-wangsu-father-and-brother:p004" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">初，<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-063-wangsu-father-and-brother:p004:m0002" ref="kix_r92_2ed">賾</persName>之收<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-063-wangsu-father-and-brother:p004:m0005" ref="l1w_swd_dj8">肅</persName>父<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-063-wangsu-father-and-brother:p004:m0007" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AA">奐</persName>也，司馬<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-063-wangsu-father-and-brother:p004:m0012" ref="7ta_hkm_0pz">黃瑤起</persName>攻<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-063-wangsu-father-and-brother:p004:m0016" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AA">奐</persName>殺之，故詔云然。</p>
</text>
